OfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1369740241637085188","date":1615406496000,"rawContent":"Economic inequality cannot be addressed without addressing racial inequality. Raising the minimum wage to $15\/hr a step toward addressing the longstanding wage gap. #Fightfor15 #BlackLivesMatter https:\/\/t.co\/WzwWcecOqe https:\/\/t.co\/wpBhIh7sqL","media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/EwJLfaSXcAcMVP9?format=jpg&name=orig"],"username":"RaiseUptheSouth","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":11.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":264,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":158,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":10.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1369770328541499394","date":1615413670000,"rawContent":"We already put up with so much. Low wages, unsafe workplaces, and a company that doesn\u2019t respect us. On top of that, many women also deal with the threat of sexual harassment. Everyone should be safe on the job. #metoo, @McDonalds. #Fightfor15 https:\/\/t.co\/IYKaSMZRxY","media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/EwJm2skXYAIHZ5p?format=jpg&name=orig"],"username":"RaiseUptheSouth","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":12.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":264,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":159,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":1.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":11.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1370012181492813833","date":1615471332000,"rawContent":"Barbara\u2019s story is too common. She, and many others, suffered sexual harassment on the job at @McDonalds. Stand with survivors to call on McD's to do the right thing to address the culture of harassment across their business. https:\/\/t.co\/g6z3eDmeUc #metoo #Fightfor15 https:\/\/t.co\/hzKdicc4GG","media":["https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/EwNC0V